OL,3,ASunshine to return to parts of UK with
OL,4,Awarmer and drier weather on way
OL,5,
OL,6,FDon't pack away your summer clothes
OL,7,Fjust yet as warmer and drier weather
OL,8,Fcould be set to return to the UK next
OL,9,Fweek.
OL,11,FTemperatures could reach as high as 25C
OL,12,Fin parts of England and Wales - several
OL,13,Fdegrees above the average for the time
OL,14,Fof year.
OL,16,FForecasts for early next week show an
OL,17,Farea of high pressure building near the
OL,18,FUK. This will largely block Atlantic
OL,19,Fweather systems, which often bring wind
OL,20,Fand rain, from reaching the country.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
