OL,3,ASunshine to return to parts of UK with
OL,4,Awarmer and drier weather on way
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth-west Scotland will see some rain
OL,7,Fbut these systems are not expected to
OL,8,Fpush across the rest of the UK, so this
OL,9,Fwould mean drier weather with lighter
OL,10,Fwinds and higher daytime temperatures
OL,11,Ffor most.
